{
  "description": "An 18 meter+ above ground level Sycamore Maple tree, heavily inundated with ivy, abutting the brick garden wall separating 145 Grosvenor Avenue from the neighbouring property of 143 Grosvenor Avenue, to be pollarded and reduced to a height of sub -10 meters above ground level. The tree is very top heavy with a shallow root system, leans towards the house and poses a direct threat to our house specifically our daughters' bedrooms. The tree as present also blocks out a substantial amount of light and has been the subject of several complaints from out neighbours as 143 Grosvenor Avenue.\r\n\r\nWorks as agreed via email amendment:\r\nCrown to be reduced to 9m above ground level height.",
